                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The .stat and .ddy files that came with the EPW, when the publisher ships them — design days and the climate summary. Empty for a file that has none.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">32bbe42a-d61b-454d-bcb4-5d5117e4ab88</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Extra Files</item>
