                    <chunk name="param_input" index="8">
                      <items count="7">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Edge of a larger square [m] filled with GEDTM30 ground (OpenGeoHub, 30 m, CC BY 4.0) outside the LiDAR terrain square, so the CFD domain floor can reach further than the tiles: the offset between the two models is measured at the seam (median over a band just inside the LiDAR edge) and the join is blended over that band. The Domain becomes this square. Must be larger than Terrain Size, at most 20000 m. Optional; 0 or unset = no ring.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">37c31e5d-3926-4def-a9cb-cd912c4af4a5</item>
