                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Purpose: Pedestrian-level PET maps from a PALM-4U large-eddy simulation of a small site.
Fidelity: Experimental - skeleton workflow for the PALM-4U plugin.
Method: PALM Domain (64 x 64 x 48 cells, 2 m), buildings, trees, terrain and OSM land cover feed PALM Case; 2 h, 3 m/s westerly.
Result: Time-averaged bio_pet field from PALM Results; PALM Progress follows the container run.
Needs: Eddy3D Setup &gt; Urban microclimate / LES / RANS (PALM-4U). Runtime: hours.
Edit: Domain size and resolution, STL buildings and trees, terrain, wind, simulated time; toggle Fetch for land cover.</item>
